<div style="background-color: #fff; width: 100%">
   <div class="box">
      <div class="body" id="body">
      <div class="block flex">
         <div class="left">
            <div class="overview subhead">
               Overview
            </div>
            <div class="abstract body-text">
               The General Mission Analysis Tool (GMAT) is the world&#039;s only enterprise, multi-mission, open source software system for space mission design, optimization, and navigation. The system supports missions in flight regimes ranging from low Earth orbit to lunar, libration point, and deep space missions.  GMAT is developed by a team of NASA, private industry, public, and private contributors and is used for real-world mission support, engineering studies, as a tool for education, and public engagement.
            </div>
                                       <div class="request-button">
                  <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/gmat/" target="_blank">Download Now</a>
               </div>
                     </div>
         <div class="right">
            <div class="details">
               <div class="col-lg-12 tablehead">Software Details</div>
               <div class="col-lg-12"><hr/></div>
